          <data key="d12">NAD-dependent protein deacylase sirtuin-5, mitochondrial</data>
          <data key="d13">Regulatory protein SIR2 homolog 5; SIR2-like protein 5</data>
          <data key="d16">NAD-dependent lysine demalonylase, desuccinylase and deglutarylase that specifically removes malonyl, succinyl and glutaryl groups on target proteins. Activates CPS1 and contributes to the regulation of blood ammonia levels during prolonged fasting: acts by mediating desuccinylation and deglutarylation of CPS1, thereby increasing CPS1 activity in response to elevated NAD levels during fasting.</data>
